2026-08-16T14:17:35Z    [ADI:Revenue] GATE critic: Your anchor is a FY2026Q3 “guidance_mid” of $3.9 billion ± $100 million. ADI typically issues guidance only one quarter ahead; unless there is a specific FY2026 Q3 guidance release, this $3.9b figure is likely for a different quarter (e.g., FY2025 Q3) and has been carried forward. Using a misperioded guidance anchor makes the 3,873.91 USDm forecast a wrong-period estimate. This can be checked directly against the company’s FY2026 Q3 guidance press release—if none exists, the basis is wrong.
